{"t":"Emberwing","s":"emberwing-5a9f7","k":"creature","i":"assets/wiki/Emberwing_ce2533.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><i>This page is about the Familiar 'outfit' Emberwing. For the summoned creature, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin%20Familiar\">Paladin Familiar</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Emberwing</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Emberwing\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Emberwing_ce2533.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin%20Familiar\">Paladin</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"method\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Method</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Buy the <a href=\"#/wiki/Summon%20Paladin%20Familiar\">Summon Paladin Familiar</a> spell.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought in<br/>Store</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.40.5409<br/>July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Familiars\">Familiars</a> <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-familiar-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This familiar has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-familiar-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Emberwing used to be the name of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin%20Familiar\">Paladin Familiar</a> until the Winter Update 2020, when these summons were renamed to Familiars and new outfits for the Familiars were introduced.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Familiars\">Related Familiars</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Free_Familiars\">Free Familiars</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bladespark\">Bladespark</a></li><li>Grovebeast</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Moonhunter\">Moonhunter</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mossmasher\">Mossmasher</a></li><li>Omniphant</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandscourge\">Sandscourge</a></li><li>Skullfrost</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Snowbash\">Snowbash</a></li><li>Thundergiant</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["dangerous-depths-quest"]}